Embedded React: export unstable_batchedUpdates.

Modified from Embedded React (Apache-2.0, Copyright 2026 Cory Lamming) at the
revision pinned in dependencies.lock.json, after the patches listed before this
one there. Changed files: bridges/quickjs/js/src/renderer.js,
bridges/quickjs/js/src/embedded-react/index.js and
bridges/quickjs/js/src/embedded-react/index.d.ts.
Not proposed upstream: PS5 React maintains this change here.

The bridge runs its frame pump and native events inside React's batchedUpdates,
but a host's own per-frame JavaScript callback runs outside it, where every
setState renders on its own: PS5 React's frame callback delivering ten images
and stepping a virtualized list rendered eleven times. The package now exports
the reconciler's batchedUpdates as unstable_batchedUpdates, the name React
Native gives it.

